message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Donghyunram (동현램): a single-player city-smashing laboratory in the manner of Rampage, with the monster, starting city and lives set through the esoteric language Donghyun-lang"
type: software
version: "0.04"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
authors:
